'''Kaftia''' is [[Adonia|Adonia's]] third-largest and second-most-populous continent, covering approximately 36 million km². It is separated from [[Fosia]] and [[Illypnia]] by the [[Shendan Ocean]].

==Etymology==
The name Kaftia comes from [[w:Greek language|Aetolian]] ''kafto'' (καυτό) meaning "hot".

