== Political geography ==
Kaftia comprises 72 recognised sovereign states, ranging from large continental powers like [[Jarin]] (2.97 million km²) and [[Wagad]] (2.35 million km²) to small island nations like [[Neridea]] (2,489 km²) and [[Sanyan]] (3,511 km²).

